6. Turn on super key to open menu on startup
```
sudo apt install xfce4-appfinder -y
```
```
Name=Xcape Super Key
Description=Open menu on Super key press
Command=xcape -e 'xfce4-appfinder'
```

6. Turn on super key to open menu on startup
```
sudo apt install synapse -y
```
```
Name=Xcape Super Key
Description=Open menu on Super key press
Command=xcape -e 'synapse'
```

6. Turn on super key to open menu on startup
```
sudo apt install xcape -y
```
```
Name=Xcape Super Key
Description=Open menu on Super key press
Command=xcape -e 'Super_L=Alt_L|F1;Super_R=Alt_L|F1'
```

7. Replace lxpanel with xfce4-panel xfce4-docklike-plugin
```
sudo apt install xfce4-panel xfce4-docklike-plugin
```

7. Replace lxpanel with plank
```
sudo apt install plank
```
